<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2KOR - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kor</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Bakorinti</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA GA KABIRI EMWA ABAKORINTI</para>
  <para style="h">AGA KABIRI EMWA ABAKORINTI</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA GA KABIRI EMWA ABAKORINTI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Enshokolezi: Paolo acîmanyîsa, abâna omusingo anavuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Paolo, ntumwa ya Yezu Kristu oku bulonza bwa Nyamuzinda, rhwe na mwene wîrhu Timoteyo, oku Ekleziya ya Nyamuzinda eri e Korinti n’oku batagatîfu boshi bali omu Akaya yoshi. <verse eid="2CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Kuli mwe enshôkano n’obuholo bw’emwa Larha Nyamuzinda na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu!<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Ayâgirwe Nyamuzinda, Îshe wa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, Larha w’obwonjo na Nyamuzinda wa ngasi burhûlirize; <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>ye rhurhûliriza omu mbaka zîrhu zoshi, mpu lyo nîrhu rhurhûliriza abandi omu ngasi malibuko n’obwo burhûlirize rhuhâbwa na Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Nêci, kulyâla amababale ga Kristu garhulugîre kwo n’oburhûlirize burhulugîre erhi Kristu orhuma. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Rhukalibuka erhi burhûlirize n’okucira kwinyu birhumire, bwo bamuhà oku mwalemberamwo amababale rhudwîrhe rhwalembera nîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>N’obulangâlire bwîrhu muli mwe bwenêne bukomîre: rhumanyire oku obûla mushangîre malibuko maguma nîrhu, mukolaga mwayish’ishangîra n’okurhûlirizibwa haguma nîrhu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Nanga, bene wîrhu, rhurhalonzizi muhabe amalibuko rhwabwîne omu Aziya, gàrhurhindibuza bwenêne, gàrhalusa emisî yîrhu, ciru rhurhali rhucilangalîre nti rhwabêramwo omûka. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Okuli, kwo rhwàli rhuyôsire nka abatwirîrwe okufà, lyo rhuleka okukacîkubagira emisî yîrhu rhwêne, ci rhubè Nyamuzinda ye rhucîkubagira, ye fûla abafù. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Yêne ye warhulîkûzagya oku lufù lungana olwo, ye wanacirhulîkûza kuli lwo; nêci, ye rhucîkubagira oku acirhuciza kandi. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Ninyu murhurhabâle n’ensengero zinyu, lyo eyo nshôkano bantu banji barhushobôlera erhuma omunkwa gwavugwa rhwe rhurhumire.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Paolo kubêshera bamubêshîre</para>
  <para style="s1">Ecarhumaga Paolo atamala amanalalira mpu ayisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Irenge lîrhu bw’obûla buhamîrizi bw’omurhima gwîrhu guhamîriza oku mw’eri igulu, na bwenêne emunda muli, rhwayôsire omu butagatîfu n’omu kurhabêsha, n’okwôla rhwakuhâbagwa na Nyamuzinda. Rhwayôsire ntyo, arhali oku bwenge bw’omubiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obwenge bw’omubiri, bwo bwenge buyegemera eby’en’igulu. </char></note>, ci oku burhabâle bw’enshôkano ya Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Bulyâla omu maruba gîrhu ntà kandi kantu rhuyandikamwo okuleka ebimusomamwo n’ebi muyumvamwo. Nnangâlîre nti mwayumva lwoshi lwoshi, <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>nka kulyâla mwayumvîrhe hitya oku rhwe igwârhiro ly’obukuze bwinyu, kulya ninyu mwa yish’ibà igwârhiro ly’obwîrhu Olusiku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olusiku lwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, lwo lusiku lw olubanja luzinda.</char></note> lwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Obwôla bulangâlire bwo bwarhumaga nnonza okurhang’ihika emwinyu, nti muhâbwe enshôkano ya kabiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enshôkano ya kabiri: masîma g’okubonakwo Paolo obwa kabiri ekarhî kâbo.</char></note>; <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>kurhenga emwinyu naderha nti ntwîkanye omu Macedoniya, na kurhenga e Macedoniya nshubire emwinyu, ninyu mwâli mwandusa munampise omu Yudeya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Ewe, k’erhi ndalira ntyo bwifudukwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abashombanyi ba Paolo bakâg’iderha mpu anakahiga binji, ci mpu arhajira ebi ahiga.</char></note> nakulaliraga? Nîsi k’eyo migabo yâni erigi ya bunya-mubiri, na ntyo nâbâmwo «nêci, nêci,» na «nanga, nanga» caligumiza? <verse eid="2CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Nyamuzinda orhagalula akanwa kâge ye ndahîre: ebinwa mmubwîra birhabà «nêci na nanga». <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Bulyâla olya Mugala wa Nyamuzinda, Yezu Kristu, rhwammubwîraga rhwe na Silvano na Timoteyo arhali «nêci na nanga»; arhabâmwo orhali «nêci». <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Nêci, ebi Nyamuzinda alaganyagya byoshi, «nêci» wabyo muli Ye abà. Ye narhuma rhwaderha «Amen»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Amen» kuli kuderha: «Nêci ntyo! Kwo biri ntyo, ebi odesire bisêzire».</char></note> w’irenge rhuhà Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Orhuzibuhya haguma ninyu muli Kristu n’owarhushîgaga amavurha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amavurha g’obubatizo.</char></note>, ye Nyamuzinda, <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>ye wanarhuhiragakwo ecimanyîso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ecimanyîso cirhazazika c’Obubatizo n’Obukomezo. Ecikinja ca Mûka: lyo Isakramenta ly’Obukomezo.</char></note> câge, anaheba ecikinja ca Mûka omu mirhima yîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Niehe Nyamuzinda ye ndahîre oku buzîne bwâni, oku kummufà lukogo kwarhumaga ntaciyishe e Korinti. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Arhali kuderha nti rhurhegeke obuyêmêre bwinyu, ci nti rhuyûshûle obusîme bwinyu; bulya omu buyêmêre muli bazibu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Nalalira obwôla nti ntashubira emwinyu omu burhè<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paolo arhalonza okushubilêrhera Abakorinti oburhè.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Bulyâla erhi nakammulêrhera oburhè, ndi wankacirhuma nashagaluka aha nyuma y’olya nalêrheraga oburhè? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>N’akabà nayandisire ebi mumanyire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maruba marhanzi Paolo ayandikiraga Abakorinti; ci ago maruba gahezire. Abalenga banaderhe oku aga burhanzi gahezire, gala marhanzi go gàli ga kabirhi, n’aga ga kabiri go gàli ga kasharhu.</char></note>, kwàli kuderha nti lyo hano nyisha ntag’ibà burhè erhi abâli bakwânîne okunsimîsa bàrhuma, bulya mmanyire oku okusîma kwâni kunali kwinyu mweshi. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Nêci, burhè bunji nàlimwo n’omutula omu murhima erhi mmuyandikira, erhi nnandi omu mulenge arhali kuderha nti mmujire burhè, ci nti lyo mumanya oku obuzigire; bwâni kuli mwe buli bunji bwenêne.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Akabà hali owajirîne burhè, arhali nie abujizire, ci mweshi, erhi nderhe oku baguma muli mwe abujizire lyo ntagibugera. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Burhali buhane bunyi obwo kuli oyo muntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuntu wagayisagya Paolo. buno ahûnyire abakristu b’e Korinti mpu bababalire oyo mwene wâbo.</char></note> wahanyirwe na banji. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Mumubabalirage erhikwo munamuhire omurhima omu nda, oyo muhanya alek’irhogera omu burhè bulushire olugero. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Co cirhumire mmuhûnyire nti muyêrekane obuzigire kuli ye. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>N’erhi nyandika, kwàli kuderha nti mmurhangule, nnandole erhi obumvi bwinyu burhali bwa bihimbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galya maruba makali ago Paolo adesire; nkaba nshonyi zarhumire bagarhera!</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Ci kwônene oyu mubabalîre - akabà hali kantu namubabalirekwo- mwe mwarhumire namubabalira omu masù ga Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Mumanye rhwankarhebwa na Shetani! Emihigo yâge rhurhayihabiri.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kurhenga e Trowa kuhika e Macedoniya. Obugo bw’entumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Erhi mpika e Trowa nti mpanûle Omwanzi gw’Akalembe gwa Kristu, oku bamanyigulira olumvi muli Nyakasane, <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Omurhima gwâni ntumvagya gurhûzire, bulyâla nabula bushanga mwene wîrhu Tito. Nabasengaruka obwo, najà e Macedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Ci Nyamuzinda ayâgirwe, orhuhimira ngasi mango muli Kristu, olumîza akasûnunu k’obumanye bwâge hoshi hoshi n’omukolo gwîrhu! <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Nêci, omu masù ga Nyamuzinda, rhuli kasûnunu kinjinja ka Kristu omu karhî k’abacira n’omu karhî k’abahera. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Kuli baguma rhuli kasûnunu ka lufù kahêka ebwa lufù, oku bandi rhuli kasûnunu ka buzîne kahisa oku buzîne. Omukolo mutyo ndi wankaguhasha? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Bulyâla rhwêhe rhurhali aka banji, bakaz’irhimbûla oluderho lwa Nyamuzinda; ci nka bantu nkana, nka bajà-bugo ba Nyamuzinda, rhuyigîriza muli Kristu embere za Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Ewe, ka rhushub’igwîra okucîkunga rhwêne? Nîsi nkabaga kukwânîne, aka baguma, rhubè n’amaruba g’okucîmanyîsa emunda muli, erhi g’emwinyu? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Mw’oyo mwe maruba gîrhu, mayandike omu mirhima yîrhu, gamanyikîne n’okusomwa n’abantu boshi. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Nêci, kurhafulikwa, muli maruba ga Kristu rhwasiribaga rhwênene, n’ago maruba garhali mayandike n’obwîno, ci n’Omûka gwa Nyamuzinda ozîne; garhali mayandike oku mbaho z’amabuye, ci oku mbaho z’emibiri, oku mirhima yinyu. <verse eid="2CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Kwo rhucîkubagire Nyamuzinda ntyo, erhi Kristu orhuma. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Arhali kuderha mpu oku bwîrhu rhugwêrhe buhashe bwa kuderha mpu kantu kalebe kali kuli rhwe. Nanga! obuhashe bwîrhu kuli Nyamuzinda burhenga. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Ye wa­rhuhâga obuhashe bw’okubà bajà-bugo b’endagâno mpyâhya; n’eyo ndagâno erhali ya lwandiko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwandiko - Endagâno ya Mîra - kuyirha luyîrha, bulya luhâna amarhegeko, ci lurhahâna misî ya kugashimba. Mukà yêhe - Endagâno Mpyâhya - buzîne abâna.</char></note>, ci ya Mûka. Bulya olwandiko kuyîrha luyîrha, ci Mûka buzîne abâna. <verse eid="2CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Erhi obujà-bugo bw’olufù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obujà-bugo bw’olufù: bulya amarhegeko ga mîra, owagavunaga, lufù atwîragwa. Ci ntà misî obwo bugo bwahânaga y’okugashimba bwinjà.</char></note>, bwàli buyandisirwe oku mabuye, bujiraga irenge lingana halya, ciru bene Israheli barhankalozire Mûsa ebusù erhi bulangashane b'obusù bwâge burhuma, n’obwo kugera bwageraga, <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>kurhi obujà-bugo bwa Mûka bwankabulaga irenge lilushire? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Bulyâla, erhi abâga obujà-bugo bw’olwayâga bwàli irenge, kurhi obujà-bugo bw’olwayâza bwakabulaga kubona irenge lilushire? <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>N’erhi rhwankaligerera kw’eri irenge lilushire bwenêne, irenge ly’obujà-bugo burhanzi liri ntâlyo <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Bulyâla, ebyagera erhi bibaga byabonesire omu irenge, ebirhagera kurhi? Ka bibule bwarhalusa irenge kulusha?<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Kuziga obwôla rhugwêrhe obulangâlire bwa bene obwo, rhugwêrhe aha rhucîkubagîre. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Arhali aka Mûsa wakâg’icîbwîka obusù mpu bene Israheli ba­nkabona oku obwo bulangashane bwàli bwa okugera bwayûrha. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Ci obukengêre bwâbo bwatûha. Bulya kuhika olusiku lw’ene, nka basoma Endagâno ya mîra, olwôla lusîka ho lunacibà. Lurhasâg’ikûlwa, bulya, Kristu olurhenza. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Nêci, kuhika olusiku lw’ene, nka basoma Mûsa, olusîka lunabasîke emirhima. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Erhi omuntu ahindukira, Nyakasane, lyo olusîka lutwîka. <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Nyakasane abà Mûka, n’aha Omûka gwa Nyakasane guli, ho n’omuntu abà ntagengwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Ci rhwêhe kuno rhunali, obusù burhali bubwîke, rhudwîrhe rhwabonekamwo irenge lya Nyakasane nk’omu ndolero<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abashimbûlizi ba Kristu bali nka ndolero (cilolero) y’irenge lyâge; naye Kristu yo nshusho n’endolero y’irenge ly’Îshe.</char></note>, rhudwîrhe rhwahindulwa mpu rhushushe n’eyo nshusho, rhulangale kulusha rhunalangashane, nk’oku Nyakasane alonzize, bulya abà Mûka.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Co cirhumire, rhwe rhwabêrîrwe obwonjo erhi rhuhâbwa obwo bugo, rhurhagonyâla. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Ci okuhulika erhi nshonyi zirhuma, rhurhacikubâmwo. Obwenge bw’okurhebana rhurhabubâkwo, n’oluderho lwa Nyamuzinda rhurhaluhindula. Ci omu kuyêrekana okunali mwo rhucîmanyikiza oku mirhima y’abantu omu masù ga Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>N’akabà Emyanzi y’Akalembe rhuyigîriza eciri mifulike, balya bâhera bo enafulisirwe, <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>balya barhayêmêra, balya Nyamuzinda w’en’igulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shetani oyo ocihamba mpu yekola nn’eri igulu, ye olya wabwira Yezu mpu amuharamye! (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:9-11">Mat 4, 9-11</ref></char>). Ntâye arhamanamanakwo.</char></note> ahusize obukengêre, mpu bankanabona obulangashane bw’Emyanzi y'Akalembe y’irenge lya Kristu, y’eri nshusho ya Nnâmahanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rhulole amahugûlo omu <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 3:18">3, 18</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Bulyâla arhali rhwêne rhuja rhwaciderha, ci Nyakasane Yezu Kristu rhuja rhwamanyîsa. Rhwêhe rhuli barhumisi binyu, erhi buzigire bwa Yezu Kristu burhuma. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda waderhaga mpu omu omwizimya murhenge obumoleke, yêne ye wanamolekeraga omu mirhima yîrhu, mpu obulangashane bw’irenge lya Nyamuzinda liri ebusù bwa Kristu bumanyibwe.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amalibuko n’obulangâlire bw’abajà-bugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Ci kwônene obwo buhirhi omu mibiri y’obudaka rhubugwâsize, lyo bamanya oku obuhashe butyo kuli Nyamuzinda burhenga, ci arhali kuli rhwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Rhufundêrîre enyunda zoshi, ci rhurhahinangusiri; rhurhamanyiri cici rhulangâlirage, ci erhi rhunalangâlîre. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Barhurhindibuza, ci rhurhali balîkirire; barhukubire, ci rhurhahimirwi. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Amababale g’olufù lwa Yezu, rhugadwîrhe omu mubiri gwîrhu ngasi hoshi na ngasi mango, ly’obuzîne bwa Yezu nabo bubonekera omu mubiri gwîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Bulya, ciru rhukabà rhuzîne, ngasi kasanzi rhuli batwîre okufà erhi Yezu orhuma, ly’obuzîne bwa Yezu nabo bubonekera omu mubiri gwîrhu gwâfè. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Ntyo olufù ludwîrhe lwajira omukolo gwâlwo muli rhwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">olufù luli lwajira omukolo gwâlwo: Omukolo n’amalibuko g’obugo'bw’entumwa binyihya amagala gâzo, ci byo birhuma Nnâmahanga ashobôza abemêzi obuzîne bw’okuli. Kwo omuganda ashusha Nnawâbo Yezu ntyo; Yezu acîhânyire bunguke bw’abandi, kwo n’entumwa y’okuli ejira.</char></note>, ci muli mwe buzîne.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Ci kulya kubà nshôkano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nshôkano ya Mûka Mutagatîfu.</char></note> nguma y’obuyêmêre rhugwêrhe, nka kulya biya­ndisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116">Lul 116</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Nayêmîre, co canarhumaga nshambâla</char>, nîrhu rhuyêmîre, co cinarhuma rhushambâla; <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>bulya rhumanyire oku owafûlaga Nyakasane Yezu, ayish’irhufûla nîrhu haguma na Yezu, anayish’irhuhira aha burhambi bwâge haguma ninyu. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>N’ebyo byoshi mwe bibêra, mpu lyo enshôkano nyinji kulusha erhuma omunkwa gwaluga, gunaluze abaguvuga, lyo Nyamuzinda ajà irenge.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Co cirhuma rhurhagonyâla. Ci oku omuntu orhuli embuga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuntu orhuli embuga gwo mubiri, n’orhulimwo, bwo buzîne rhwashobôlaga erhi rhuhinduka bâna ba Nnâmahanga omu Bubatizo.</char></note> ashandâla, omuntu orhulimwo ahinduka muhyâhya ngasi lusiku. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Bulya okwôla kulibuka hityungunu kwa hisanzi hitya kurhurheganyiza kulusha ngasi lugero omwandu gw’irenge ly’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Co cirhuma rhurhalola ebiboneka, ci ebirhaboneka; bulya ebiboneka birhashinga kasanzi, ci ebirhaboneka biri by’e­nsiku n’amango.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Rhumanyire oku erhi eci cihando<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogwo mûbako, gwo mubiri gw’irenge rhwâfûkane (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:44-45">1 Kor 15, 44-45</ref></char>).</char></note> rhubâmwo hano igulu cankashabûka, rhugwêrhe enyumpa yayûbakagwa na Nyamuzinda, mûbako gw’ensiku n’amango gurhàjiragwa na nfune za muntu, gunali omu irunga. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Gw’ogu mulenge rhulimwo mw’obu bwôrhere; rhudwîrhe rhwacîfinja nti omûbako gwîrhu gw’omu irunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omûbako gw’omu Irunga rhuguyambalîre oku ogwo gundi: Rhwankalonza okujà omu irenge ly’ensiku n’amango buzira okurhang’ifà.</char></note> rhuguyambalîre oku gundi, <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>casinga rhurhimâmwe rhuyambîrhe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5, 3: Abayish’ishimânwa bayambîrhe, bo balya bâbè bacizîne, banali bajira ebijiro by’obulangashane amango Mwâmi Yezu agaluka; n’abâshangwe bashugunu, bo barhacibwisiri irenge lya Kristu kandi erhi bo balya bayish’ibà bafîre amango Kristu ayisha (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-53">1 Kor 15, 51-53</ref></char>).</char></note>, ci rhurhashangagwa rhuli bashugunu. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Nêci, oku rhunaciri mw’eci cihando, erhi omu mulenge rhunali n’omu malibuko; kulya kubà rhurhalonza okuhogolwa ogwo mwambalo, ci rhuguyambalîre oku nyanya y’ogundi, mpu omubiri gwîrhu gw’olufù guhinduke buzîne. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>N’owarhubumbiraga okwo, anali Nyamuzinda yêne, ye wanarhuhâga Mûka Cikinja.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Kuziga, akabà ntyo, rhugwêrhe aha rhucîkubagîre, rhunamanyire bwinjà oku: «oku rhunacirimwo ogu mubiri, erhi n’emwa bene rhunali, kulî na Nyakasane; <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>bulya buyêmêre rhudwîrhe rhwagendamwo, ci arhali masù». <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Rhurhwalihire obwo, rhurhankanabaga rhurhengemwo ogu mubiri, rhuj’ibêraho Nyakasane. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Na ntyo, rhubêziremwo ogu mubiri, rhubîre rhurhagubêziremwo; kumusimîsa rhulonza. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Bulyâla rhweshi kukwânîne rhuboneke aha lukîko lwa Kristu, lyo ngasi muguma âhâbwa amakwânane g’ebi ajizire aciri omu mubiri, binjà erhi bibî.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukolo gw’obugo bw’entumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Na ntyo, bulya rhuyishi oku kwânîne okuyôboha Nyakasane, rhudwîrhage rhwayêmêza abantu. Nyamuzinda yêhe rhulangashîne omu masù gâge. Ninyu nnangâlîre nti rhulangashîne omu mirhima yinyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Arhali kucîkunga rhwashubigwîra okucîkunga emunda muli, ci kuderha nti rhummuhè ecarhuma mwacîkuza erhi rhwe rhurhuma, lyo mubona oku mwashuza balya balimbira ebiboneka, babule bwalimbira ebiri omu murhima. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Akabà rhwahezize obukengêre Nyamuzinda orhumire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hali abakâg’ilongôza Paolo mpu arhalusire olugero, mpu adwîrhe ajira nk’ogwêrhwe n’isirhe. Akabà ajizire nka muntu ohezire obukengêre, Nnâmahanga warhumaga ajira ntyo; n’aka obukengêre bwâge buli bugumaguma, bemêzi barholamwo obunguke. </char></note>, mwe kwabêra. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Nêci, buzigire bwa Kristu burhuminisire. Kwo rhugerêreza oku akabà muguma afirîre boshi, kuziga boshi banafîre. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Boshi anafirîre, mpu abalimwo omûka barhacicîbêreragamwogwo, ci babè olya wabafîraga anabafûkira ye bagubêreramwo.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Rhwêhe murhakacibona rhwamanyira omuntu ebwa mubiri, akaba rhwalimanyîre Kristu bunya-mubiri ci lero buno arhaciri kwo rhumumanyire. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>N’omuntu erhi akabà ali muli Kristu, erhi anakola ali ciremwa cihyâhya; okwàli burhanzi kwahwîre, byoshi bikola bihyâhya. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Okwôla kwoshi, yo kurhenga emwa Nyamuzinda, owashubig’irhujira bîra bâge oku bulagizi bwa Kristu, anarhuhà obugo gw’okushubiza abandi omu bwîra bwâge. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda yêne washubizagya igulu omu bwîra bwâge muli Kristu, erhi ayibagira obubî bw’abantu, n’erhi arhuheba ekanwa enderho z’okushubiza abandi omu bwîra bwâge. <verse eid="2CO 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Ntyo rhuli bajà-bugo ba kîrhu. Oku izîno lya Kristu, rhummuhûnyire, mwe mukasinga; shubiri omu bwîra bwa Nnâmahanga! <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Orhali oyishi ecâha, amujira câha rhwe rhurhumire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnâmahanga abarhuzize Mwâmi Yezu obuhane bwoshi bw’ebyâha b’igulu.</char></note>, mpu lyo muli ye rhushuba bushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Na bulya ye rhudwîrhe rhwarhabâla, rhummuhûnyire nti murhalekaga e­nshôkano ya Nnâmahanga yagera busha. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Kulya kubà adesire, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6, 2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Iz 49, 8</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Omu mango gakwânîne nakuyumvîrhîze, n’omu lusiku lw’okucira nakurhabîre</char>. Amango gakwânîne go gano, olusiku lw’okucira lwo luno. <verse eid="2CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Rhurhasârhaza ndi, nti lyo barhagayaguza obujà-bugo bwîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Ci omu ngasi kantu, kwo rhunaciyêrekana nka baganda ba Nyamuzinda: omu kuzibuhira bwenêne amalibuko, omu malumwa n’omu burhè; <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>omu kushûrhwa empîmbo, omu mpamikwa, omu bugome, omu mirhamo, omu kubula îrò, n’omu kubula ebiryo; <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>omu bucêse bw’omurhima, omu bumanye, omu kulembera amalibuko, omu butûdu, muli Mûka Mutagatîfu, n’omu buzigire bw’okunali; <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>omu luderho lw’okuli, n’omu buhashe bwa Nnâmahanga; omu kukolêsa amatumu gw’okufungira n’okulwîra obushinganyanya; <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>omu kukengwa n’omu kulolwa nka byâsi, omu kuderhwa kubî n’omu kuderhwa kwinjà; omu kujirwa ndyâlya, n’obwo rhurhaderha ebirhali by’okuli; <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>mpu barharhwîshi, obwo ntâye orhuhabire; mpu rhuli obufà, n’obwo rhuli mitaraga; mpu rhuli bahane, ci barhankarhuyîrha; <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>mpu rhuli burhè, n’obwo rhurhayôrha rhurhashagalusa; mpu rhuli ba buligo, n’obwo banji rhugaza; mpu rhurhagwêrhi kantu, n’obwo ntâco rhurhajira. Abakorinti nabo bayigule emirhima. <verse eid="2CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Ntà kantu rhummufulisire, wâni Bakorinti! Omurhima gwîrhu gwoshi guli mwigule! <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Nanga! murhafundêriri emunda rhuli; ci omu mirhima yinyu mwo mufundêrîre. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Ninyu murhugalulirage! Kwo mmubwîzire nka kulya omuntu anabwîra abâna bâge: ninyu muyigule omurhima gwinyu gwoshi gwoshi!<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Mumanye mwakashangîra mulindizo muguma n’abarhali bemêzi. Bici obushinganyanya bwankashangîra n’obubî? Nîsi buguma buci obumoleke bwankajira n’omwizimya? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Bwîra buci Kristu agwêrhe bona Beliyari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beliyari ye Shetani.</char></note>? Nîsi bici omwemêzi ankashangîra n’orhali mwemêzi? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Aka-Nyamuzinda bici kankafundikira haguma n’enshusho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eidolos omu cigereki: «nshusho z’abazimu», kandi rhwanaderha nti «nshanga».</char></note> z’abazimu? Rhw’ono, nêci, rhwe rhuli nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda bici kankafundikira haguma n’enshusho z’abazimu? Rhw’ono, nêci; rhwe rhuli nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda ozîne, nk’oku Nnâmahanga aderhaga, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6, 16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:45">Lub 29, 45</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Nabêra omu karhî kâbo nnankabagerageramwo</char>. <char style="qt">Nâbà Nyamuzinda wâbo, nabo babè bantu bâni</char>. <verse eid="2CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/><char style="qt">Rhengagi ekarhî kâbo, munaciyegûle, kwo Nyakasane adesire</char>. <char style="qt">Mumanye mwankahuma oku kantu karhacîri, nâni nammuyankirira</char>. <verse eid="2CO 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/><char style="qt">Nâbà nie sho, ninyu mubè bagala bâni na bâli bâni, ye kudesire Nyakasane ogala-byoshi</char>.<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Obûla rhugwêrhe endagâno ya bene eyo, bîra bâni, rhucîkûlekwo ngasi izinga ly’omubiri erhi ly’omurhima, rhuyûkirize omukolo gw’okucîjira bimâna omu kurhînya Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="2CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Murhuyigulire emirhima yinyu! Ntâye rhwalenganyize, rhurhahombagya ndi, ntâye rhwalîre hyâge. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Ntadesiri ntyo nti mmuyagirize. Ka ntarhenzir’i­mmubwîra oku muli omu mirhima yîrhu omu kufà n’omu kulama! <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Kurhali kunyi ncimmwikubagîre; mwe munali bukuze bwâni bunene. Omurhima gwâni gurhulwîre;, nyunjwîre bushagaluke omu malibuko gîrhu goshi.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo e Macedoniya yo Tito amushiganaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Bulyâla, erhi rhuhika e Macedoniya, rhurhaderhaga ciru mpu omubiri ogu gwamarhamûka. Ci ntâkwo rhurhalibukaga: embuga entambala, erhi nie ono, n’omu nda obwôba, erhi nie ono. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Ci Nyamuzinda orhûliriza abazamba arhurhûliriza omu kuyisha kwa Tito; <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>arhanali omu kuyisha kwâge mwône, ci n’omu burhûlirize abwîne ekarhî kinyu. Arhubwîzire olwifinjo lwinyu, oburhè muli, n’obushiru bwinyu kuli nie, na ntyo nasîma bwenêne kulusha.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Ciru akabà nammujizire burhè, n’amaruba gâni, ntagayiri; n’akabà nali ntanzir’igaya, -mbwîne oku ago maruba gàli gammujizire burhè, ciru akabà hyàli hisanzi hisungunu, - <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>buno nkola nsîmire, arhali okwenge mwâli burhè, ci kulya kubà obwo burhè bwarhumire mwacîyunjuza. Bulyâla oburhè mwâli bwa kuli Nyamuzinda, na ntyo ntà kantu kabî rhwammujirîre. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Nêci, oburhè bwa kuli Nyamuzinda, kulêrha bulêrha obucîyunjuze; ci oburhè bw’igulu bwôhe, lufù bulêrha. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Loli ninyu mwêne eci obwo burhè bwa kuli Nyamuzinda bwammudwîrhîre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oburhè bwa kuli Nnâmahanga: Bulya buhane Abakorinti bahâga olya wagayisagya Paolo. Erhi babà bamamuhana, ahinduka mwinjà.</char></note>. Loli bukombêdu bunganaci! Arhanali hoshi aho. Loli kurhi mwacîngayire mpu mucîyêze! Loli burhè bunganaci! Loli bwôba bunganaci. Loli buhane bunganaci? Loli bushiru bunganaci. Muli ebyo byoshi mwayêrekîne oku muli bêru-kwêru mw’olwo lubanja. <verse eid="2CO 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>N’akabà nammuyandikîre, arhali olya wagayisanyagya ye warhumire, arhanali olya bagayisagya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olya bagayisagya: omuntu Paolo arhumaga e Korinti.</char></note>. Kwàli kuderha nti obukombêdu bwinyu kuli rhwe bubonekane embere za Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Okwôla kwo kwarhurhûlirize.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Okwo kurhûlirizibwa kwîrhu kwanacijakwo obusîme bulushire bwenêne, erhi rhubona Tito asîmire, bulyâla mweshi oku munali mwarhumire omurhima gwâge gwadêkerera. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>N’akabà omu masù gâge hali oku nacisîmire erhi mwe murhuma, ntakubêraga nshonyi. Ci nka kulyâla rhwammubwîraga byoshi oku binali, ntyo kwo n’okucîsîma kwîrhu omu masù ga Tito kwayishirig’ibà kwa kunali. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>N’obuzigire bwâge kuli mwe bukola bulushisize, akakengêra obumvi bwinyu mweshi, n’oku mwamuyankiriraga munayôbohire munadwîrhe mwageramwo omusisi. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Nsîmire obûla omu ngasi hyoshi nanacimwîkubagira mw’oyo.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Ensholôlo z’okurhabâla abemêzi b’e Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="s1">Ecarhuma barhabâla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Rhulonzize okummumanyîsa, bene wîrhu, enshôkano Nyamuzinda àshobôzize Ekleziya z’e Macedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Omu malibuko manji babwîne, obushagaluke bwâbo bunene n’obukenyi bwâbo bunji byayunjulirîne, byahinduka buhirhi bwa kurhabâla abandi. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Nk’oku banali bahashire, niene mpanyire obwo buhamîrize, ciru na kurhalusa obuhashe bwâbo bwône, <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>bayish’irhuyinginga mpu rhubashobôze nabo enshôkano y’okushangîra ogwo mukolo gw’okurhabâla abatagatîfu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abo batagatîfu, bo bakristu b e Yeruzalemu.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Balushîriza ciru aha rhwàli rhulangâlire là! Barhag’ijà aho, bacîhâna bône emwa Nyakasane, okubundi bacîhâna emwîrhu oku bulonza bwa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Rhwanacihûna Tito obwo, nti obwôla ali amârho­ndêra ogwo mukolo gw’okurhabâlana aguyunjulize emwinyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Ci kulya mulushana muli byoshi: omu buyêmêre n’omu kumany’iderha, n’omu buzigire rhwammuyigîrizagya, ntyo kwo munalushanage na mw’okwo kurhabâla abandi. <verse eid="2CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Lirhali irhegeko mmuhîre ene nderha ntyo; ci kuderha nti mbè nkanarhangula erhi obuzigire bwinyu bunali bo omu kushîbirira abandi. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Murhahabiri enshôkano ya Nyakasane Yezu Kristu, oku ye wali mugale acîjiraga mukenyi mwe murhumire, mpu lyo obukenyi bwâge bummujira bahirhi. <verse eid="2CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Ihano kwône mmuhîre mw’okwo; okwôla kwo kunamukwânîne mwe mwarhondêraga ogo mukolo kurhenga mwâka injo. Arhanali kurhondêra okugujira kwône, ci n’okugulonza. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Nêci, ogwo mukolo muguyujuzagye, na ntyo kulyâla mwâli mubiduhire omu kulalira, kwo munashubig’ibiduha n’omu kujira, nk’oku munahashire. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Obulonza bukabiduha, eci omuntu agwêrhe co cinarhuma asîmwa, ci arhankadôsibwa eci arhagwêrhi. <verse eid="2CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Ntadesiri nti mukûle abandi olukoba emumiro, mucîhiremwolo, ci nti muyumanyanye. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Mw’okûla rhuli buno, ebimmulugîre birhabâle obukenyi bw’abinyu, lyo ebibalugîre nabo biyish’irhabâla obukenyi bw’abinyu, na ntyo muyumanyanye, <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>nka kulya biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Lub 16, 18</ref></char>: Ebyo binwa biyêrekîre amâna, bene Israheli balyaga omu irungu.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Owali orhôzire binji birhamulugiraga, n’owali orhôzire, binyi birhamunyihiraga</char>.<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa Paolo ali arhumire e Korinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Mushâna Nyamuzinda ayâgirwe! owahiraga obu bushiru kuli mwe omu murhima gwa Tito. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Ayumvîrhe izù lyâni. Ciru abà bushiru kulusha, ayishire emwinyu oku kulonza kwâge yêne. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Rhumurhumîre bo na mwene wîrhu muguma, olya irenge lyâge omu kulumîza Emyanzi y’Akalembe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wabona Luka oyo adesire.</char></note> liderhwa omu Ekleziya zoshi. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Arhanali kwône okwo: acîshozirwe n’Ekleziya mpu anyôse rhukaz’ibalama rhwe naye mw’ogûla mukolo gw’enshôkano rhwacîhânyirekwo, lyo Nyakasane ajà irenge, lyo n’omurhima gwîrhu gurhûlûla. <verse eid="2CO 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Kulonza okwôla nti harhag’ijira owarhutumuza kw’ogûla mwandu gw’ebirugu barhubarhuzize. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Bulyâla rhulonza okujira aminjà, arhali omu masù ga Nyamuzinda mwône, ci n’embere z’abantu. <verse eid="2CO 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Rhubarhumîre bo n’olya mwene wîrhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyo «mwene wîrhu» rhurhishi ye ndi; Paolo arhamudesiri izîno.</char></note> warhuyêresire kanji kanji oku anabà mukombêdu, na buno acîyêrekîne wa bushiru kulusha bulya acimmwîkubagire bwenêne. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Tito yêhe ye wîrhu rhubà rhwe naye, ye nantabâla oku mukolo ekarhî kinyu. Abandi bene wîrhu, Ekleziya zibarhumire, bali irenge lya Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Embere z’Ekleziya mubayêreke oku obuzigire bwinyu bunali bo, n’oku obwîkubagire rhummugwêrhemwo burhali bwa busha.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Nago ogôla mukolo w’okurhabâla abatagatîfu, ntacirhamya nti na­mmuyandikira kuli go. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Bulya ntahabiri oku mubiduha, mwe ncitakîra e Macedoniya, nti: «Akaya yôhe ecirheganyize kurhenga mwâk’injo». N’obushiru bwinyu bwatuzire banji. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Mmurhumirage obwôla bene wîrhu, nti lyo okwo kulimba rhummulimbamwo kurhag’ibà ntâko muli okwo, lyo munabà mucîrheganyize nk’oku naderhaga, <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>erhi ab’e Macedoniya bankayisha bandusize, barhag’ishanga murhacirheganyizi, enshonyi zirhugwârhe -ntag’iderha nti mwe- muli obwôla bulangâlire. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Omurhima gwambwîraga obwo mpu kukwânîne ntume bene wîrhu banshokolere emwinyu, barheganye erya nsholôlo yinyu mwalaganyagya, eyôrhe eri nteganye, -enabè nsholôlo y’okuli, ci karhabaga kantu ka bujinisi.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda azigira ohâna anashagalusire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Kengêri: orhwêra binyi, binyi anasarûla; n’orhwêra binji, binji, anasarûla. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Ngasi muguma ahâne nk’oku omurhima gwâge gunamubwîzire; arhahânaga nk’oli burhè, nîsi erhi nk’osêzîbwe; bulya Nyamuzinda azigira ohâna anashagalusire<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:8">Mig 22, 8</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Câba Nyamuzinda anahash’immushobôza enshôkano za ngasi lubero, lyo mubona ebi mmukwânîne muli byoshi na ngasi mango, mubul’isigaza ebi mwajiramwo ngasi mukolo mwinjà. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Ntyo kwo biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:9">Mig 22, 9</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 112:9."><ref loc="PSA 112:111--1">Lul 112(111), 9</ref></char></note>: <char style="qt">Agabire aminjà gâge, ashobôza abakenyi; obushinganyanya bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango</char>.<verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Olyâla ohà omuhinzi emburho n’omugati alya, ammuhà ninyu emburho erhali nyi, anayiluze, anammuyûshulire amalehe g’obushinganyanya bwinyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Ntâho murhacigalira obwo, munakolaga mwâbona oku mwankarhabâla abà­ndi omu ngasi kantu, na ntyo Nyamuzinda avugwe omunkwa oku bulagizi bwîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Bulyâla ogwo mukolo Mutagatîfu kurhali kurhabâla kwône gurhabâla abatagatîfu omu bulagîrire bwâbo, ci ciru gurhuma bavuga Nyamuzinda omunkwa bwenêne. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Oburhabâle bwinyu bukolaga bwâbazibûla amasù, bagashânize Nnâmahanga, kulya kubà mwayêmîre okuyêrekana Emyanzi y’Akalembe ya Kristu buzira kuyibêra nshonyi, na bulya murhajiraga bujinisi omu kubarhabâla n’omu kurhabâla boshi. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>N’okushenga bammushengera kuyêrekîne oku bwenêne bammurhonya, bulyâla enshôkano Nnâmahanga ammushobôzize eri nyinji bwenêne. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Nyamuzinda akonkwa oku nshôkano yâge erhankaderhwa!<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="ms1">III. Paolo ashuza balya bâli bamushobesire</para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo arhabà ngonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Niehe Paolo mmuhûnyire, mwe mukasinga, obutûdu n’obwinjà bwa Kristu burhumire, nie erya ngonyi nka ndi embere zinyu, na nka ntammuliho nshube ntwâli. <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Mmuhunyirage, mwe mukasinga, hano mpika eyo munda, ntarhengagamwo bulya burhwâli abagerêreza mpu mubiri gurhuhêka bacikêbwa mpu mbamwo. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Omu mubiri rhubà, nêci, ci rhurhalwa kwa mubiri. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Nanga, amatumu rhulwamwo garhali ga bunya-mubiri, ci oku buzibu bwa Nyamuzinda gagwêrhe obuhashe bw’okuhongola ebishagala by’entambala by’abashombanyi. Emirâli rhwe rhuyitwamwo, <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>na ngasi bucîbone buderha mpu bwacîgererakwo okumanya Nyamuzinda, na ngasi bukengêre rhubugwârha mpira nti bushige Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Na hano obumvi bwinyu bubà bwimâna, rhulingûzize okuhana ngasi yêshi waciderhe mpu arhenguha.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Okuli mûshi murhakubishaga! Ocîkubagire mpu ali wa Kristu, ashub’icija emurhima, amanye oku ali wa Kristu kwo nîrhu rhuli bâge. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Bulya, ciru obwo buhashe bwîrhu nankabulimbira okurhalusire olugero hitya, obwo buhashe Nyakasane àrhuhâga mpu rhummuyûbakemwo mwoyo, arhali mpu rhummushâbemwo ntankabubêra nshonyi. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Bulyâla ntalonzizi mumanye mpu kummuyôbohya nnonza okummuyôbohya n’amaruba gâni. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>«Amaruba gâge, kwo baderha, gali ga bulume ganali makali; ci erhi wankamubona yêne, ngonyi, n’iderha lyâge liri ntâlyo»; <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Olimw’okwo kwa bene okwo, amanye oku oku rhuyôrha omu iderha ly’amaruba gîrhu nka rhurhahali, kwo rhwanayish’iyôrha omu bijiro bîrhu hano rhubà rhukola rhuli ekarhî kinyu.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo arhabà mucibonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Rhurhadesiri nti rhucihiremwo oburhwâli bw’okucîyumanyanya nîsi erhi obw’okucîgererakwo balya bacikunga bône. Ci omu kucîkunga bône n’omu kucîshushanya bône na nnene, ntà bukengêre! <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Rhwêhe rhurhacîkuza kurhaluka olugero<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olugè lw’omukolo gw’obugo bwa Paolo, liri igulu lyoshi. Muli okwo ntâye wankaderha mpu acigerera kuli ye.</char></note>, ci olugero Nyamuzinda arhugereragamwo erhi arhuhisa emwinyu, lwo rhwanacîgereramwo. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Rhurhanagandâzizi okurhalusire olugero lwîrhu, nka kulya rhurhali rhushubig’ihika emwinyu; ci rhwammuhisireho erhi rhummudwîrhîre Emyanzi y’Akalembe ka Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Rhurharhalusire olugero n’okucîkungira emirimo ya bene, ci rhucîkubagîre oku, omu kuyûshûka emunda muli buzira kurhalusa olugero lwîrhu, <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>rhunalangâlîre okuhisa Emyanzi y’Akalembe omu zindi ntambi kurhaluka emwinyu, ahâli h’okulimbira emikolo mikole omu kwa bene. <verse eid="2CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Owalonza obukuze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Owalonza obukuze…: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:22-23">Yer 9, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1 Kor 1, 31</ref></char>.</char></note>, abulongeze muli Nyakasane! <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Bulya arhali ocîkunga yêne ye gera, ci oyu Nyakasane akunga.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Paolo asêzîbwe okucîkuza yêne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Acibâga mwankanzigira nasirâha hitya! Câba nêci mwandembera <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Bulyâla okuyâgala munyâgîre kuli kuyâgalwa kwa Nyamuzinda. Kulya kubà nammuhîre mulume muguma yênene, nka mwâna w’obunyere orhashubig’ihumwakwo w’okuyêreka Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Ci kwône nyôbohire bwenêne nti e­nkengêro zinyu zakasherêra zinacîkûle omu bwimâna bwa Kristu, nka kulyâla enjoka yarhebaga Eva n’obwenguhuza bwâyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Bulyâla erhi hankajira owayish’immuyigîriza owundi Kristu okuleka olya rhwammuyigîrizagya, erhi kwa­nkaba kuhâbwa owundi Mûka okuleka olya mwahâbagwa, nîsi erhi yindi Myanzi y’Akalernbe okuleka erya mwayankiriraga, murhankabula bwayêmêra! <verse eid="2CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>N’obwo ncîkêbirwe nti ezo «ntumwa nkulu» ntâco zindushire! <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>N’akabà ntà bulenga bw’e kanwa njira, obumanye bwoki ntabuziri muli byoshi n’embere za boshi rhwammuyêresirekwo.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Ka kubîha nabîhirage erhi nyunama nti mmulengeze, mmuyigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe ka Nnâmahanga buzira kuhûna kantu? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Zindi Ekleziya nanyazire, zo zampîre oburhabâle oku mukolo gwâni ekarhî kinyu. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>N’obwôla nali emwinyu ntanagwêrhi cici, ntazidoheraga ndi; bene wîrhu bàhubukaga e Macedoniya bo bampîre ebi nal’indagîrirekwo. Muli byoshi nacîlanga nti ntag’immuzidohera, nanacicîlanga. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Okuli kwa Kristu kundimwo kwo ndahîre: ako kalimbiriro kâni ntâye wankakankulamwo omu cihugo c’Akaya! <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Bulya kurhi? Ka mpu bulya ntammuzigira? Nyamuzinda yêne amanyire!<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Oku nyôrha njira, nashub’ikakujira, lyo mbatwîra omu myanzi balya bakaz’ilonza aha bankalimbira mpu bayumanana nîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Bulya abantu ba bene bo liri irumbi mpu ntumwa, bakozi endyâlya bakâg’irhebana mpu ntumwa za Kristu. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>N’okwo kurhankasomeza ndi; bulya Shetani naye anacîyôze nka malahika wa bumoleke. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Kuziga kurhali kudârhi abaganda bâge nabo bacîyôze nka ntumwa za bushinganyanya. Ci obuzinda bwâbo kwo nabo bwanabà ak’ebijiro byâbo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Nashub’iderha là: harhabaga owamanya mpu ngwêrhwe n’isirhe. Na mukakuderha, yêmêragi mbè musirhe, lyo nâni mbà nka nacîkunga hitya. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Oku nkola naderha, ntakuderhe oku bwa Nyakasane, ci nka kula omusirhe anabà, erhi nnamanyire bwinjà oku ngwêrhe ebyankalimbirwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Kulya kubà bandi banji bacîkunga kwa mubiri, ka nâni ntang’icîkunga! <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Mwe benge, murhahugûga amadâga mubà mweshi! <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Nêci, banammujire bajà, munacihumbire; bakammulya babishi, munacihulikire; banammunyage, ba­mmugayaguze, ammuhè ciru n’omulimba omu irhama, murhanahinye. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Nkudesire nti lyo enshonyi zimmugwârha. Nkaba kwo mumanya mpu rhurhali balume!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ci ngasi eci balimbira coshi, -ka nkuderhe nk’ogwêrhwe n’isirhe, - nâni, nanacîrimbira. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Bali Bayahudi, nâni ndi wundi! Bali b’oku nkomoka y’Abrahamu; ci nâni! <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Bali Baganda ba Kristu, -lêro nkola naderha nka musirhe, ­ -nie ono mbalushire! Mbalushire omu kuluza emikolo, omu kushwêkwa kanji-kanji omu kushûrhwa okurhalusize olugero. Kanga nalinzir’ifà? <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Karhanu koshi nashûrhwa n’Abayahudi erya mikoba makumi asharhu na mwenda. <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>E­mpindo nazishûsirwe kasharhu; nabandwa amabuye liguma; nazika omu nyanja kasharhu; nashinga mulegerere muguma na budufu buguma omu ndalâlà y’enyanja. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Kanji-kanji erhi omu njira ndi; enyîshi zampusha; nalinz’igwa omu bishumûsi; nalinz’iyîrhwa n’ab’emwîrhu; abapagani bampusha; nalinz’ifira omu cishagala; omu irungu niene niene; enyanja yalinz’impêka; nalinz’iyîrhwa n’endyâla mpu bene wîrhu. <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>mbalushire omu kukola n’omu kurhama; kanji-kanji nalazire ntanahebiri olugohe oku lundi; ishali n’enyôrha, okucîshalisa kanji-kanji, okukayûla n’okubula eci nacibwîka. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Ntadesiri n’ebindi… Ngasi lusiku erhi omurhima gukangalire erhi Ekleziya zoshi zirhuma. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Ndi ôbà ngonyi, nkanabula bwagonyâla nâni? Ndi ohirima, nkanabula bwayumva mbabîre bwenêne?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Akabâga kwo bàdesire mpu rhucîkuze, niehe buzamba bwâni nalimbira. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Nyamuzinda n’Îshe wa Nnawîrhu Yezu -olya okayagirwa ensiku n’amango! - arhahabiri oku ntanywerha. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>E Damasi, omurhambo wa mwâmi Areta àrhegeka mpu balange olugo lw’e Damasi lyo bangwârha. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Omu cirhimbiri bampebire, bacigeza aha kabonezo, banyandagaza oku lukûta, na ntyo namufulumuka omu nfune.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Akabà kukwânîne rhucîkuze, -ci kunali kurhamira busha.- nkolaga naderha n’oku Nyakasane ambonekeraga n’ebi ambishûlîre. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Nyîshi omuntu muli Kristu hamagera myâka ikumi n’ini. Oyo muntu, -erhi ali ahêsire omubiri, ntishi erhi agusiga ntishi, Nyamuzinda yêne amanyire, - erhi bamuzirundukana omu malunga, bamuhisa omu irunga lya kasharhu. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Nyîshi oku oyo muntu, erhi ali ahêsire omubiri, ntishi, agusga, ntishi, Nyamuzinda yêne amanyire, - <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>bamuzurundukîne omu paradizo, ayumva ebinwa birhankaderhwa; ebi ayumvîrhe omuntu arhayêmêrîrwi okubiderha. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Oyo muntu, nêci, nanamulimbira; ci nie niehe ntankalimbira oburhali buzamba bwâni. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Ncilonzagya okucîkuza, lirhankabire isirhe; bulya ntankadesire ebirhali by’o­kuli. Ci nalekeraga aho, hakanajira owacinyikebwa mukulu kulusha oku abwîne ndi, nîsi erhi oku ayumva naderha.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Lyo n’obukulu bw’ebyo banfulûliraga burhag’irhuma nacîbona, bampeba akababo omu mubiri, kali nka ntumwa ya Shetani ekaz’intimba ebifundo. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Namahûna Nyakasane kasharhu erhi okwôla kurhuma, nti amuntenzekwo. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Naye ambwîra, erhi: «Enshôkano yâni erhakunyihiri; bulya obuhashe bwâni omu buzamba mwo bucîyerekana». Nkolaga nsîmire okulimbira obuzamba bwâni, lyo obuhashe bwa Kristu bumbêramwo. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Okwôla kwo kurhuma nyumva nsîmire omu buzamba bwâni, omu bijâci, omu malibuko, omu kurhi­ ndibuzibwa n’omu burhè, erhi Kristu orhuma. Bulya amango ndi muzamba, lyo mbà muzibu! <verse eid="2CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Ka ntashubirage musirhe! Mwe mwanarhumire. Kali singa mwe mwâli gwâsirwe okunkunga! Bulya ntâco ndushirwe n’abo bali ntumwa nkulu, ciru nkaba ntali cici. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Ebiyêrekana oku ndi ntumwa, mwabibwîne ekarhî kinyu: okulembera ngasi malibuko, ebimanyîso, ebisômerîne n’ebirhangâzo. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Ezindi Ekleziya cici zahâbirwe murhahâbagwa, aha nyuma ly’okubà nie ono ntammuzidoheraga? Mumbabalire okwôla kubîha nammubîhîre! <verse eid="2CO 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Bukola bwa kasharhu obu ncîrheganyize okujà emwinyu, ntanammuzidohere. Arhali abâna bo bagwâsirwe babîkire ababusi. Ci ababusi bo babîkira abâna bâbo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Niehe nnonzize okuhâna byoshi n’okucîhâna niene nieshi-nieshi erhi mwe murhuma. Obûla mmuzigire kulusha, ka kukwânîne munzigire kunyi? <verse eid="2CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Erhi «Kubage!» nie ono ntammuzidoheraga; ci kulya kubà nali mwengûza, nammugwârhira omu bwenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eryo iderha lyàli lya bashombanyi ba Paolo.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Ewe, k’abanarhumaga emwinyu bâli­ mwo muguma warhumire nammuyungukirakwo? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Nayinginga Tito, nanamurhuma bo n’olya mwene wîrhu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12, 18 </char><char style="xta" closed="false">Lolà </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:18-22">2 Kor 8, 18-22</ref>.</char></note>. Ka Tito ammuyungukirekwo? K’arhali njira nguma rhwalimwo, muguma akula okugula aha, owundi akuhebe ho?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo ayôbohire okurhimâna Abakorinti omu mabî</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Kurhenga mîra mucîkêbwa mpu kusamba rhusamba embere zinyu! E­mbêre za Nnâmahanga rhuderhera muli Kristu. Ebyo byoshi, bene wîrhu, kuderha nti mujè embere. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Bulya nyôbohire nti nkaba hano nyisha, arhali oku nnonzize mubè kwo nashanga muyôsire; nti ninyu mwakanashanga nyôsire oku murhalonzizi mbè; nti nakanashanga mulimwo ennongwè, obwâgalwa, omungo, orhudali, okuderherana kubî, okuhûranana, obucîbone n’akavuli­ndi. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Nyôbohire nti amango nashubira eyo, Nyamwagirwa Nyamuzinda akanambonêsa enshonyi embere zinyu, nti hakanajira banji nalakira bajizire ebyâha, banabula bwacîyunjuza oku bijiro byâbo by’okubî, by’okuhusha n’e­by’okukala enshonyi.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Bukola bwa kasharhu obûla njà emwinyu. Ngasi lubanja lukatubwa oku cinwa ca bahamîrizi babiri erhi basharhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bahamîrizi babiri erhi basharhu: <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 1:15">Lush 1, 15</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Nakubwîzire balya bajizire ebyâha burhanzi, nakubwîra n’abandi boshi, nnabà nanashub’ikuderha kandi ene ntabalimwo, nka kulya najiraga erhi ndi eyo obwa kabiri: nkashubira eyo, lêro ntâbe bwonjo. <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Nkabaga mulonzize mubone oku Kristu odwîrhe aderhera omu kanwa kâni? Yêhe erhabà ngonyi embere zinyu, ci ajira obuhashe muli mwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Abambiragwa oku musalaba erhi kugonyâla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kugonyâla: kugonyohala.</char></note> kurhuma, ci azîne oku buhashe bwa Nyamuzinda. Na nîrhu, rhuli ngonyi muli ye, nêci, ci rhwayish’iyôrha rhuzîne haguma naye oku buhashe bwa Nyamuzinda muli mwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Ninyu mwene mubage nka mwagerêreza, mulole erhi munali omu buyêmêre; mucîrhangule mwene. Ka ninyu mwene murhamanyiri oku Yezu Kristu ammulimwo? Nkaba abage erhi muli mihera! <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Ahâli nkaba mwamanya oku rhwêhe rhurhali mihera! <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Rhudwîrhe rhwashenga Nnâmahanga ammurhabâle murhajiraga okubî; arhali kuderha nti lyo babona oku rhuyâzize, ci kuderha nti lyo mw’oyo mujira okwinjà, rhubè rhwe rhuyâga. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Bulyâla rhurhagwêrhi buhashe bwa kulwîsa okuli, ci bwa kulwîra okuli bwône rhujira. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Nêci, rhusîma rhw’ono rhubè ngonyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abakorinti babà bazibu olugendo lwâbo lukaba lwimâna, Paolo anabà ngonyi obwo, bulya arhacigwêrhi igwârhiro ly’okukolêsa obuhashe bwâge, na ntyo anayâga.</char></note>, ninyu mubè bazibu. Kwo rhunashenga omu nsengero zîrhu okwo: nti mushube bimâna. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Co cirhumire nayandika nnandi kuli eco, nti lyo hano mbà nkola mmuliho, ntag’ikaliha omu buhashe Nyakasane a­mpâga mpu nyûbake, ci arhali mpu nshabe.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">Enfundiko</para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano. Omusingo. Obwangà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Ntyo, bene wîrhu, mushagaluke, mucîsêze okubà bimâna, muhânane omurhima, muyumvanye, mubè n’omurhûla, na Nyamuzinda w’omurhûla abà ninyu. <verse eid="2CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Mulamusanye n’ehinunugurho hitagatîfu. Abatagatîfu boshi ba­ mmulamusize. <verse eid="2CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Enshôkano ya Nyakasane Yezu Kristu, n’obuzigire bwa Nyamuzinda, n’omulungano gwa Mûka Mutagatîfu bibè ninyu mweshi!<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
